    "english":  "Her wide, cool eyes, streaked with red lines of longing,\nhave suffered deep distress; the swaying leaf-garment\nadorns her slender hips, and her form shines like sapphire.\nWhose daughter is this lovely maiden who has brought such sweet torment\nto a heart that never knew love\u0027s pain? Long may her father live!\nAnd may the mother who bore her receive honors rich and lasting,\nsplendid as Tondi, the harbor town of the Chera king Poraiyan,\nwhere the mud-spread fields are reaped by sturdy farmers\nand the eye-like blue neytal flowers bloom in profusion beside the rice-stacks!",
